{"bookId":"cp-5","editionId":"48cce4d1d7388361","chapterId":"c0034","paragraphs":[{"id":"p2496d4f60b22-1","text":"春深浅，一痕摇漾青如剪"},{"id":"p5dea946621c0-1","text":"青如剪"},{"id":"p4d927d2a42a4-1","text":"鹭鸶立处，烟芜平远"},{"id":"p1e78779bdcca-1","text":"吹开吹谢东风倦，缃桃自惜红颜变"},{"id":"p1e123991d1f9-1","text":"红颜变"},{"id":"paa60c7099ae2-1","text":"兔葵燕麦，重来相见"}]}